{"4932360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gloom", "steam_appid": 4932360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, and all else alike, are corrupt with sin, stuck in this vile wasteland. The only path to atone is to vanquish the tarnished foes roaming about. Do so by exploring, killing monsters and trading blackrock and souls for items that provide unique synergies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE NOT ALONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrupt as your allies may be, fighting with up to 4 teammates may prove favorable on your quest to redemption.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two ventures into the wasteland are the same. Completely procedurally generated layouts and several uniquely purposed rooms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how you explore the wasteland, where to allocate resources and what rooms to risk going into at the cost of getting stronger or potentially dying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ITEM, SYNERGIES AND UPDGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items are the pillar of strength. Each item has a unique effect and uniquely interacts with other items, creating absurd synergies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VILE CREATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wasteland is swarming with tarnished wicked creatures. Vanquish enemy fodder, flee from foes stronger than you, challenge mini-bosses and eventually topple the amalgamations of sin, plaguing this land. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, and all else alike, are corrupt with sin, stuck in this vile wasteland. The only path to atone is to vanquish the tarnished foes roaming about. Do so by exploring, killing monsters and trading blackrock and souls for items that provide unique synergies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE NOT ALONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrupt as your allies may be, fighting with up to 4 teammates may prove favorable on your quest to redemption.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two ventures into the wasteland are the same. Completely procedurally generated layouts and several uniquely purposed rooms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how you explore the wasteland, where to allocate resources and what rooms to risk going into at the cost of getting stronger or potentially dying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ITEM, SYNERGIES AND UPDGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items are the pillar of strength. Each item has a unique effect and uniquely interacts with other items, creating absurd synergies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VILE CREATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wasteland is swarming with tarnished wicked creatures. Vanquish enemy fodder, flee from foes stronger than you, challenge mini-bosses and eventually topple the amalgamations of sin, plaguing this land. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "short_description": "A co-op horror game set in dark civil war era America. You and everything else in the land have been tainted rotten. Find redemption in vanquishing the embodiments of sin.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932360/a28ce1d7b02d63bcba5808bcbbf35e47a67165b8/header.jpg?t=1787693393", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932360/b2c5e4709652576a3ce4caf149c12dbcd3693002/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787693393", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932360/b2c5e4709652576a3ce4caf149c12dbcd3693002/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787693393", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 / Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB 